      design: RatificationRefused [terminal]  // S:840,843 {proposal, reason: NotOpen, actor}
      // sees: RatificationRefused{NotOpen}, then a notice to the answerer (S:895); a repeat with the same answer ref is a silent no-op (S:854). NDD
