        triggered-by ProposalWithdrawn  // S:891 "ResolveQuestion(Withdrawn) for its ratification question" (policy ProposalWithdrawnWithdrawsQuestion)
      clarification: QuestionResolved  // S:891 ResolveQuestion(Withdrawn) for its ratification question closes it in flmnt, plus a notice to its recipients
      design: ConstructInvalidated  // S:892 SupersedeConstruct(by: none, cause: SubjectChanged) for each created construct
      design: MarkStale  // S:893 "an entry source → Placement MarkStale(proposal)"
        triggered-by ProposalWithdrawn  // S:893 "an entry source → Placement MarkStale(proposal)" (policy ProposalWithdrawnMarksPlacementStale)
      design: PlacementMarkedStale  // S:893,427 an entry source: MarkStale(proposal) -> {proposal, SubjectChanged}
      clarification: QuestionAsked [outcome]  // S:511 AskQuestion to the source's author
      // A withdrawal increments that proposal's created constructs and the cascade repeats until nothing changes (S:846). Not drawn: a Gap source
      // (DisposeGap(Resolved{Fixed, SubjectChanged}), S:893), the stale-versions Propose (BoundaryChangeProposed and ProposalWithdrawn in one write,
