      // T13.O13 · The boundary is settled (terminal)
      // note design: "The convergence read model folds the recorded events into the baseline and the inputs of the verdict"  // S:1002 the convergence read model: every ContextMap proposal that is open
      // PROVES: no open proposal in the convergence read model for the change (S:1002)
    when ARatifiedBoundaryGivesTheResolverOneMoreTry
      // T13.M4 · a ratified boundary construct that a posted question could now offer gives the resolver one more try (S:1060)
      design: BoundaryChangeRatified  // S:837 "BoundaryChangeRatified {answer ref}"
      clarification: ResolveQuestion cause Withdrawn  // S:1060 "If it settles the question, the question is resolved as any computed answer (the posted question withdrawn Computed)"
